  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">In a box of pens, the ratio of black pens to red pens is <math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math> to <math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn>\n</math>. There are <math alttext=\"40\"><mn>40</mn>\n</math> black pens in the box. How many red pens are in the box?</p>",
